---
// Thoughtly case study, rebuilt without Webflow. Content and layout match live Webflow.
// Dark page: BaseLayout's dark theme gives the charcoal background and the dark header.
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CaseStudyQuote from '../../components/customers/CaseStudyQuote.astro';
import thoughtlyLogo from '../../assets/customers/thoughtly/thoughtly-logo-white.svg';
import thoughtlyLogin from '../../assets/customers/thoughtly/thoughtly-login.png';
import torreyLeonard from '../../assets/testimonials/torrey-leonard.webp';
import victorSanchez from '../../assets/testimonials/victor-sanchez.jpeg';
import { LINKS, SITE } from '../../lib/constants';
import { articleNode, breadcrumbNode, pagePath } from '../../lib/seo';

const TITLE = 'Thoughtly Found an Auth0 Alternative for Multi-Tenant Auth';
const DESCRIPTION =
  'Discover how Thoughtly unified auth for product-led growth and enterprise sales by moving from Auth0 to Wristband\u2019s multi-tenant architecture.';
const OG_IMAGE = '/images/misc/682d7588b08074e3d22ce582_thoughtly-case-study-open-graph.png';
const DEMO_URL = 'https://calendly.com/wristband/meet-up';

const canonical = new URL(pagePath(Astro.url.pathname), Astro.site ?? SITE.url).href;
const torrey = { name: 'Torrey Leonard', role: 'Founder and CEO', photo: torreyLeonard };
const victor = { name: 'Victor Sanchez', role: 'Senior Software Engineer', photo: victorSanchez };
---

<BaseLayout
  title={TITLE}
  description={DESCRIPTION}
  ogImage={OG_IMAGE}
  ogType="article"
  theme="dark"
  jsonLd={[
    articleNode({ url: canonical, headline: TITLE, description: DESCRIPTION, image: OG_IMAGE }),
    breadcrumbNode([
      { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
      { name: 'Case Studies', path: '/customers/thoughtly' },
      { name: 'Thoughtly', path: pagePath(Astro.url.pathname) },
    ]),
  ]}
>
  <section>
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="hero__lead">
        <h2 class="hero__label">Case Study:</h2>
        <Image src={thoughtlyLogo} alt="Thoughtly logo" class="hero__logo" loading="eager" />
        <h2 class="hero__quote">
          &ldquo;Wristband is a <span class="hero__quote-highlight">must-have</span> for any enterprise SaaS.&rdquo;
        </h2>
        <h2 class="hero__attribution">&mdash; Torrey Leonard, Founder and CEO</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__media">
        <div class="hero__screenshot">
          <Image src={thoughtlyLogin} alt="Thoughtly login page" class="hero__screenshot-image" loading="eager" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="intro">
      <h1 class="intro__title">
        How Thoughtly leverages Wristband's multi-tenant features to solve authentication for their product-led growth
        and enterprise sales initiatives.
      </h1>
      <h2 class="intro__subtitle">A Conversation With:</h2>
      <p class="intro__people">
        Torrey Leonard, Founder and CEO at Thoughtly
        <br />
        Victor Sanchez, Senior Software&nbsp;Engineer at Thoughtly
      </p>
    </section>
  </section>

  <section class="stats">
    <div class="stats__row">
      <div class="stats__card">
        <p class="stats__number stats__number--sky stats__number--users">
          11<span class="stats__suffix">k+</span>
        </p>
        <div class="stats__label">Active users</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stats__card">
        <p class="stats__number stats__number--sky stats__number--migration">One</p>
        <div class="stats__label">Successful migration from Auth0</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stats__card">
        <p class="stats__number stats__number--green">Zero</p>
        <div class="stats__label">Downtime or auth issues</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story story--about">
    <h2 class="story__title">About Thoughtly</h2>
    <div class="story__body">
      <p class="story__about">
        <a href="https://www.thoughtly.com/" target="_blank" class="story__link">
          Thoughtly
        </a>{' '}
        provides AI voice agents to enterprise teams that help boost sales conversions and drive revenue. With a no-code
        interface, businesses can script conversations, customize tone and personality, and deploy in under 20 minutes.
        These agents integrate with CRMs and come prebuilt for industries like retail, real estate, healthcare, and
        more. By automating high-volume calls and accelerating lead follow-up, Thoughtly customers have achieved up to
        15x ROI.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story">
    <h2 class="story__title">The Challenge</h2>
    <div class="story__body">
      <div class="story__prose">
        <p>
          Not long after coming to market, it became evident that Thoughtly's platform delivered the most value in
          enterprise environments. In addition, they still needed a way to support their self-serve user base for small
          businesses and agencies. These dual customer segments came with fundamentally different authentication
          requirements.
        </p>
        <p>
          Enterprise buyers expected isolated user data, white-labeled domains, and customizable login flows. Meanwhile,
          Thoughtly&rsquo;s product-led growth motion relied on a common self-signup and login experience shared across
          all its users. Supporting both of these paths within a single identity system quickly proved difficult.
        </p>
        <p>
          While the team began redesigning their backend systems to support these heterogeneous use cases,
          authentication remained a sticking point. They were already using Auth0 and briefly explored their approach to
          multi-tenancy.
        </p>
      </div>
      <CaseStudyQuote {...torrey}>
        Initially, we considered looking into Auth0's multi-tenancy options, but it seemed so complex that we didn't
        even seriously pursue that avenue. It was <em>stressful just thinking about implementing it</em>.
      </CaseStudyQuote>
      <div class="story__prose">
        <p>
          Thoughtly's needs quickly outpaced what Auth0 could offer out of the box. &nbsp;The lack of native support for
          serving multiple tenant types from a single application made it hard to separate consumer and enterprise login
          flows cleanly. Furthermore, building a custom solution to bridge the gap would have slowed product velocity
          and created a long tail of complexity to manage.
        </p>
        <p>
          As Thoughtly weighed their options, the team prioritized looking for a solution that wouldn&rsquo;t drag
          engineering into months of complex setup or unclear edge cases. Wristband stood out right away with
          out-of-the-box support for various multi-tenant use cases.
        </p>
        <p>So they made the switch.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="story__quote--gap-80">
        <CaseStudyQuote {...victor}>
          There's a lot of really valuable information in the docs, especially around multi-tenancy. From what I've
          seen, <em>there's no 'gotchas'</em>. You get what you see, and that feels really good.
        </CaseStudyQuote>
      </div>
      <h3 class="story__subtitle">What Thoughtly Needed From an Auth Provider</h3>
      <ul role="list" class="story__requirements">
        <li>Support for both self-serve and enterprise login flows under a single application.</li>
        <li>
          Per-tenant user isolation to give their enterprise customers complete control over their users&rsquo;
          identities.
        </li>
        <li>Customizable policies around MFA and SSO to satisfy enterprise security requirements.</li>
        <li>Custom-branded login pages and domains for agencies that require white-labeling.</li>
        <li>Cross-tenant administration capabilities to enable internal teams to manage all customers centrally.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story">
    <h2 class="story__title">The Solution</h2>
    <div class="story__body">
      <div class="story__prose">
        <p>
          Today, Thoughtly relies on Wristband to streamline authentication across its diverse customer base. Out of the
          box, Thoughtly can now support a shared login experience for self-serve users, while also supporting dedicated
          login flows for enterprise tenants.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="story__quote--gap-60">
        <CaseStudyQuote {...victor}>
          Wristband's advanced tenant-level features are a game changer. <strong>[The]</strong> team has been extremely
          responsive, helping to streamline our authentication, <em>freeing up valuable time for our engineers</em>.
        </CaseStudyQuote>
      </div>
      <h3 class="story__subtitle">What Wristband Delivered</h3>
      <p class="story__delivered">
        Thoughtly leverages Wristband&rsquo;s multi-tenant features to support the full spectrum of their business use
        cases:
      </p>
      <div class="story__use-case">
        <h4 class="story__use-case-title">Global Tenant for Product-Led Growth Initiatives</h4>
        <p class="story__use-case-text">
          Thoughtly uses Wristband&rsquo;s Global Tenant to support logins for its end consumers, offering a unified
          login experience with self-signup enabled. Using the Wristband Dashboard, Thoughtly customized the Global
          Tenant&rsquo;s login flow by:
        </p>
        <ul role="list" class="story__use-case-list">
          <li>Configuring a custom domain so login pages are hosted under the Thoughtly domain.</li>
          <li>Updating the email domain to send messages from a Thoughtly-branded address.</li>
          <li>Customizing the appearance of hosted pages and emails to match Thoughtly&rsquo;s branding.</li>
          <li>Adding a link on the global login page to direct enterprise customers to their dedicated login page.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="story__use-case">
        <h4 class="story__use-case-title">Standard Tenant for Each Enterprise Customer</h4>
        <p class="story__use-case-text">
          Using Wristband&rsquo;s Dashboard, Thoughtly provisions a dedicated Standard Tenant for every enterprise
          customer. Each Standard Tenant gets a custom login page, allowing enterprise customers to tailor settings like
          MFA, password policies, and SSO to their specific needs. User accounts are isolated by tenant, giving
          enterprise customers complete control over their users&rsquo; lifecycle. Self-signup is disabled for
          enterprise customer tenants, so new users are onboarded through Wristband&rsquo;s invitation flow.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="story__use-case story__use-case--last">
        <h4 class="story__use-case-title">Standard Tenant for Thoughtly Employees</h4>
        <p class="story__use-case-text">
          Thoughtly employees are hosted in their own Standard Tenant. &nbsp;This provides a clear separation between
          Thoughtly end users and internal admin users. &nbsp;Using Wristband&rsquo;s roles and permissions, Thoughtly
          employees are granted access to their customers&rsquo; tenants to perform administrative tasks or provide
          customer support.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story">
    <h2 class="story__title">Zero-Downtime Migration</h2>
    <div class="story__body">
      <div class="story__prose">
        <p>
          Thoughtly engineers collaborated closely with Wristband to build scripts that extracted users from Auth0 and
          imported them into Wristband via API calls. One major concern was handling passwords, which is a common pain
          point during identity migrations. With password exports gated behind Auth0&rsquo;s higher-tier plans,
          Thoughtly used a secure reset-on-login flow to balance user experience with business constraints. Wristband
          supported this by enhancing its login workflow to automatically prompt migrated users to reset their
          passwords.
        </p>
      </div>
      <CaseStudyQuote {...torrey}>
        People thought <strong>[password reset detection]</strong> was more secure. Basically, no customers said
        anything about it except for people who were like: &ldquo;Cool, this is good&rdquo;. It was so{' '}
        <em>low friction; it just worked</em>.
      </CaseStudyQuote>
      <div class="story__prose">
        <p>
          When the migration went live, the Wristband team remained on-call to monitor everything in real time. The
          system handled the surge of thousands of users without issue, and within a few hours, the migration was
          complete and fully stable.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story story--results">
    <h2 class="story__title">Key Results</h2>
    <div class="story__body">
      <div class="results">
        <div class="results__item">
          <h3 class="results__title">Focus Kept on Core Business</h3>
          <p class="results__text">
            &#x2705; &nbsp;Saved months of engineering time by avoiding the need to build custom multi-tenant auth,
            enabling the team to stay focused on core product features.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="results__item">
          <h3 class="results__title">Streamlined Auth Unlocked Growth</h3>
          <p class="results__text">
            &#x2705; &nbsp;Removed barriers to scaling by simplifying authentication with a unified solution, enabling
            both Product-Led Growth and enterprise motions to thrive.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="results__item">
          <h3 class="results__title">Enterprise-grade Security Achieved</h3>
          <p class="results__text">
            &#x2705; &nbsp;Provided enterprise-level security features such as MFA and SSO to its customers to better
            protect their identities.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story story--conclusion">
    <h2 class="story__title">Final Thoughts</h2>
    <div class="story__body">
      <div class="story__quote--gap-top-40">
        <CaseStudyQuote {...torrey}>
          Wristband <em>out of the box is meant for enterprise SaaS</em>. As an enterprise SaaS product, it made the
          most sense for Thoughtly to use Wristband. So we made the switch, and the switch was easy. Wristband is a
          must-have for any enterprise SaaS.
        </CaseStudyQuote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta">
    <div class="cta__container">
      <h2 class="cta__title">Don&rsquo;t let auth slow your business down.</h2>
      <p class="cta__text">Start unlocking growth with Wristband&rsquo;s multi-tenant auth platform today.</p>
      <div class="cta__row">
        <div class="cta__buttons">
          <a href={LINKS.signup} class="cta__signup" set:text="Start for Free" />
          <a href={DEMO_URL} target="_blank" class="cta__demo" set:text="Request Demo" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Hero: label, logo, quote and attribution on the left, the login screenshot on the right. */
  .hero {
    display: flex;
    flex: 0 auto;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 60px 5vw 5vh;
  }

  .hero__lead {
    display: flex;
    flex-flow: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-left: auto;
    padding-right: 20px;
  }

  .hero__label {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--palette-sky-blue);
    font-size: 54px;
    font-weight: 200;
    line-height: 1.4em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero__logo {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 720px;
    height: auto;
    margin-top: -2vw;
  }

  .hero__quote {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: var(--palette-white-smoke);
    font-size: 58px;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    line-height: 1.2em;
  }

  .hero__quote-highlight {
    background-image: linear-gradient(#0049dc, #00a2ff);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .hero__attribution {
    margin: 0 0 16px 10px;
    color: var(--palette-green);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .hero__media {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    width: auto;
    height: 100%;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    padding-right: 20px;
  }

  .hero__screenshot {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 320px;
    max-width: 380px;
    height: 100%;
    max-height: 500px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 6px 5px var(--palette-charcoal);
    transform: rotate(5deg);
  }

  .hero__screenshot-image {
    display: inline-block;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  /* Title block under the hero. */
  .intro {
    margin-top: 100px;
    padding: 0 5vw;
  }

  .intro__title {
    max-width: 1300px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    padding: 0 15px;
    color: var(--palette-aquamarine);
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-regular);
    line-height: 1.3;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .intro__subtitle {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 60px auto 20px;
    color: var(--palette-white-smoke);
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
    line-height: 1.4em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .intro__people {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    color: var(--palette-white);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.66667em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Three stat cards. */
  .stats {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding: 60px 5vw;
  }

  .stats__row {
    display: flex;
    flex-flow: wrap;
    justify-content: space-around;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 15px;
  }

  .stats__card {
    display: flex;
    flex-flow: column;
    padding: 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--palette-green);
    border-radius: var(--radius-16);
  }

  .stats__number {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-size: 9vw;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    line-height: 1;
    text-align: center;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .stats__number--sky {
    background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--palette-sky-blue), var(--palette-white));
  }

  .stats__number--users,
  .stats__number--migration {
    padding-left: 20px;
    padding-right: 20px;
  }

  .stats__number--green {
    background-image: linear-gradient(0deg, var(--palette-medium-aquamarine), var(--palette-aquamarine));
  }

  .stats__suffix {
    font-size: 7vw;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .stats__label {
    color: var(--palette-white);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Story sections: a sky-blue title over a 900px column. */
  .story {
    margin-top: 0;
    padding: 40px;
    background-color: var(--palette-charcoal);
  }

  .story--about {
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  .story--results {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .story--conclusion {
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .story__title {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--palette-sky-blue);
    font-size: 54px;
    font-weight: 200;
    line-height: 1.4em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .story__body {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .story__about,
  .story__prose {
    padding-top: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    color: var(--palette-white);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.6em;
  }

  .story__about {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .story__prose p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    line-height: 1.6em;
  }

  /* Live Webflow separates paragraphs with a blank line. */
  .story__prose p + p {
    margin-top: 1.6em;
  }

  .story__link {
    color: var(--palette-green);
    text-decoration: underline;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }

  .story__link:hover {
    color: var(--palette-aquamarine);
  }

  .story__quote--gap-80 {
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .story__quote--gap-60 {
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .story__quote--gap-top-40 {
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  .story__subtitle,
  .story__use-case-title {
    background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--palette-green), var(--palette-aquamarine));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: var(--palette-white-smoke);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    line-height: 1.4em;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .story__subtitle {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-size: 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .story__requirements {
    margin: 20px 0 10px;
    padding: 0 40px;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .story__requirements li,
  .story__use-case-list li {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    color: var(--palette-white);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .story__delivered,
  .story__use-case-text {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    color: var(--palette-white);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.6em;
  }

  .story__delivered {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  /* Live Webflow leaves 30px after each use case except the last. */
  .story__use-case {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .story__use-case--last {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .story__use-case-title {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .story__use-case-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 0 0 40px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  /* Key results: one column of three. */
  .results {
    display: flex;
    flex-flow: column;
    gap: 62px;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 0;
  }

  .results__title {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--palette-pale-lavender), var(--palette-pink));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: var(--palette-white-smoke);
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.4em;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .results__text {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-left: 40px;
    color: var(--palette-white);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-regular);
    line-height: 1.6em;
  }

  /* Closing call to action on a blue gradient. */
  .cta {
    padding: 60px 5vw;
    background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--palette-sky-blue), var(--palette-indigo));
  }

  .cta__container {
    max-width: 85vw;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .cta__title {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: var(--palette-dark-gray);
    font-size: 58px;
    line-height: 1.2em;
    text-align: center;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 1px var(--palette-dim-gray);
  }

  .cta__text {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--palette-charcoal);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    text-align: center;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 1px var(--palette-dim-gray);
  }

  .cta__row {
    display: flex;
    flex-flow: wrap;
    justify-content: space-around;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 15px;
    padding-top: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .cta__buttons {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 20px;
    width: auto;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .cta__signup,
  .cta__demo {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 16px 32px;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    border-radius: var(--radius-12);
    color: var(--palette-charcoal);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    line-height: 18px;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
  }

  .cta__signup {
    background-color: var(--palette-aquamarine);
    transition:
      border-color 0.3s,
      background-color 0.3s,
      box-shadow 0.3s,
      transform 0.3s,
      color 0.35s;
  }

  .cta__signup:hover {
    border-color: var(--palette-charcoal);
    color: var(--palette-charcoal);
    transform: scale3d(0.96, 0.96, 0.01);
  }

  .cta__demo {
    border-color: var(--palette-lavender);
    background-color: var(--palette-white);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px #14142b0a;
    transition:
      border-color 0.3s,
      box-shadow 0.3s,
      transform 0.3s,
      background-color 0.3s,
      color 0.3s;
  }

  .cta__demo:hover {
